==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Shiinotic|93}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*{{a|Illuminate}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Shiinotic}} can have.
*'''Gentle Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Psyduck|70}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

